<title>NORWAY: Norsk Hydro 1996 profits per division.</title>
<headline>Norsk Hydro 1996 profits per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profits per division at Norway's largest listed company Norsk Hydro ASA for the twelve months ending December 31.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Agriculture		    2,667     vs	  2,742</p>
<p>  Oil and gas		    5,631     vs	  3,275</p>
<p>  Light metals		   1,253     vs	  3,655</p>
<p>  Petrochemicals		   287     vs	  1,138</p>
<p>  Other activites	 minus  185     vs   minus  106</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
